  narrationText: {fileID: 1345006405}
  narrationLines:
  - Now uh, here's the deal spark
  - I've got about 5 more minutes before this demo ends
  - So we're gonna do a little something called an exposition dump
  - But uh first, use the arrow keys or square i guess to launch some love at these
    bummed out emotions
  - Some of them are super bummed so you'll need to do a little grounding exersice
    before they are ready for love and affection
  - Press the down arrow in the air to do one of those ones
  - so uh yea, these little guys while your buzzing around here, are emotions, emotions
    that John has been pushing down for a long long time
  - So uh now they are kicking up a fuse and overwelming him
  - And you cant fight emotions, thats just not how they work, pushing them down
    or away just lets them become overwelming again
  - So to deal with emotions, you've gotta accept them and thats what your doing
    when your giving them love
  - cause really, everything's ok
  - There is nothing wrong with being Sad or Angry or even full of Joy
  - Yes Spark that is called foreshadowing but we dont have time for things like
    that
  - Anyway make it all the way through area's like this and maybe accepting all these
    emotions will unlock new special abilities, maybe ones similar to the ones Emotions
    are using
  - Yes Spark, that is more foreshadowing but like i've said, we dont have time
  textFadeTime: 0.25
